owing gives the plot of \n$y=f(-x)?$" :question/worked-solution "To obtain the graph of $y=f(-x)$ from $y=f(x)$, we need to reflect the graph over the $y$-axis. The resulting graph is shown below.\n\n![](images/22/2244cea90543cc32cb2c5822b5293c7bf8dfadd3d0b55793680152ef0ad04233.png)"} :step/id #uuid "94af425b-308d-557b-8c6a-3d7f9c20fed6" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186575638}}] :activity/title "Horizontal Reflections of Functions" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574938}]}
